 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "entries: 15m bare CISD (series_open, 2/2 swings, max_wait 3), decided at the confirming bar's close, next-M1-open entry, stop at the protected swing",
   "levels known at the decision: last completed Asia (20:00-00:00 NY) and London (02:00-05:00 NY) high/low, today's 08:30 NY open, previous trading day's high/low (min_coverage 0.5)",
   "target: nearest level beyond the decision close in the trade's direction whose distance is >= 1.5x the stop distance (nearer levels skipped); no trade if that level is > 3.0R",
   "ADR check: target distance <= mean range of the last 5 completed trading days minus today's range so far; else no trade",
   "exit: stop, level, or 150 minutes"
  ],
